WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.251 --> 00:00:02.070
- Here it comes.

00:00:02.760 --> 00:00:06.213
I'm getting it ready for you (laughs).

00:00:08.423 --> 00:00:12.316
(upbeat music)

00:00:14.642 --> 00:00:18.265
That's my baby's food and I'm
going to give it to people

00:00:18.265 --> 00:00:21.971
who are probably going to
say like oh this is gross.

00:00:25.111 --> 00:00:27.389
- I'm kind of hoping that it tastes like

00:00:27.389 --> 00:00:30.651
unsweetened vanilla Trader Joe's milk.

00:00:30.651 --> 00:00:33.054
- I'm hoping that it
tastes like regular milk.

00:00:33.054 --> 00:00:34.728
- Man, this is baby juice.

00:00:34.728 --> 00:00:37.616
Like this is supposed to
keep little kids alive,

00:00:37.616 --> 00:00:39.996
so I feel like it's going
to be full of nutrition.

00:00:39.996 --> 00:00:40.948
- I've always wanted to try it.

00:00:40.948 --> 00:00:42.817
I think it'll be like regular milk,

00:00:42.817 --> 00:00:45.394
but sort of like the difference
between beer and root beer.

00:00:45.394 --> 00:00:47.612
- Maybe it'll make us
feel like kids again.

00:00:47.612 --> 00:00:51.995
- I don't know why I think
it's going to be really gross.

00:00:53.905 --> 00:00:54.689
(sighs)

00:00:54.689 --> 00:00:56.034
- Oh my God, it's thick.

00:00:56.034 --> 00:00:57.187
- It's just too real.

00:00:57.187 --> 00:00:58.090
(laughs)

00:00:58.090 --> 00:00:59.949
- I can't smell a thing.

00:00:59.949 --> 00:01:01.168
- It doesn't smell like anything.

00:01:01.168 --> 00:01:02.109
Maybe chalk.

00:01:02.109 --> 00:01:03.467
- It smells like milk.

00:01:03.467 --> 00:01:05.039
Oh, does it smell sour to you?

00:01:05.039 --> 00:01:07.078
- I don't know.

00:01:08.068 --> 00:01:10.686
- It's nice eggshell green.

00:01:10.686 --> 00:01:12.231
- For our mothers.

00:01:12.231 --> 00:01:14.044
- (mumbles)

00:01:15.454 --> 00:01:16.938
- Oh hi.

00:01:16.938 --> 00:01:20.083
- Okay, you know what (laughs).

00:01:21.459 --> 00:01:23.803
- It's like pretty good.

00:01:25.243 --> 00:01:27.733
- Oh my God, it's actually really good.

00:01:27.733 --> 00:01:29.621
- There's like a kind of aftertaste

00:01:29.621 --> 00:01:31.857
that tastes like a baby smells though.

00:01:31.857 --> 00:01:33.312
- Like after I'm finished drinking this,

00:01:33.312 --> 00:01:34.298
the only thing I'm going to need

00:01:34.298 --> 00:01:37.272
is for someone to pat my
back so that I can burp.

00:01:37.272 --> 00:01:40.323
- [Voiceover] So we'd like
to introduce you to someone.

00:01:40.323 --> 00:01:41.637
- Who?

00:01:42.414 --> 00:01:44.052
That's your boob?

00:01:44.052 --> 00:01:45.095
- Is that your milk?

00:01:45.095 --> 00:01:46.163
- Yeah (laughs).

00:01:46.163 --> 00:01:47.196
- [Voiceover] Hello.

00:01:47.196 --> 00:01:48.114
- Hi.

00:01:48.114 --> 00:01:49.613
- [Voiceover] It's my milk.

00:01:49.613 --> 00:01:51.282
- Oh my gosh, we're so honored.

00:01:51.282 --> 00:01:52.722
(laughs)

00:01:52.722 --> 00:01:54.324
- [Voiceover] Surprise.

00:01:54.324 --> 00:01:56.201
- Ochi (laughs).

00:01:56.201 --> 00:01:58.645
Oh my God.

00:01:58.645 --> 00:01:59.808
- We're your babies now.

00:01:59.808 --> 00:02:00.767
- Oh, you're babies.

00:02:00.767 --> 00:02:02.323
(laughs)

00:02:02.323 --> 00:02:03.982
- This came out of a woman.

00:02:03.982 --> 00:02:06.304
- This came out of a woman's tit.

00:02:06.304 --> 00:02:07.774
- Yeah.

